text	attributesToShowCollectionVarDefText	cora	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "cora"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "coraText"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "attributesToShowCollectionVarDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2023-12-06T19:08:07.325359Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2026-03-04T11:15:34.990459Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Attribut att visa, styr vilka attribut som skall visas för den aktuella presentationen. Det finns tre möjliga nivåer:\\nAlla - visar alla attribut som finns, både de som användaren kan välja värde på och de med fast värde.\\nValbara - visar endast de attribut som användaren kan välja värdet på.\\nInga - visar inga attribut.\\nOm inget val är gjort visas alla attibut."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Attributes to display, controls which attributes are to be displayed for the current presentation. There are three possible levels:\\nAll - shows all attributes that exist, both those whose value the user can choose and those with a fixed value.\\nSelectable - shows only those attributes for which the user can select the value.\\nNone - shows no attributes.\\nIf no choice has been made are all attributes shown."}], "att