text	coraDataDefText	cora	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "id", "value": "coraDataDefText"}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "cora"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "coraText"}]}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2025-10-23T12:11:49.688238Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2025-10-23T12:11:49.688238Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "CoraData används av alla gående miljöer av Corabaserade system för att lagra data som skapas av Cora gemensamma funktioner, som t.ex. indexering och skall finnas i miljön de körs i. Datat för CoraData flyttas inte mellan olika gående miljöer."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "CoraData is used by all running environments of Cora-based systems to store data that is created by Cora's common functions, such as indexing, and should be in the environment in which they are run. The data for CoraData is not moved between different walking environments."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "CoraData brukes av alle kjørende miljøer i Cora-baserte systemer til å lagre data som er opprettet av Coras vanlige funksjoner, for eksempel indeksering, og som skal være i miljøet de kjøres i. Dataene for CoraData flyttes ikke mellom ulike gangmiljøer."}], "attributes": {"lang": "no", "type": "alternative"}}]}
