 [{"name": "text", "value": "Validation type for the record type genericCollectionItem. A genericCollectionItem represents a selection in a selection list. If you e.g. has a list with the choices Yes, No, then each choice is a separate item. The NameInData of the item is the value it will get in the picklist. The text displayed in the selection list is the text that textId links to."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
