text	metadataCollectionVariableValidationDefText	cora	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "id", "value": "metadataCollectionVariableValidationDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "cora"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "coraText"}]}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-03-02T09:02:07.249710Z"}], "repeatId": "0"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-03-02T15:22:41.158875Z"}], "repeatId": "1"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-06-16T12:26:51.942798Z"}], "repeatId": "2"}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2023-03-02T09:02:07.249710Z"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Validerings typ för posttypen metadataCollectionVariable. En metadataCollectionVariable är metadatakomponenten som används för att definera en lista av val. Det är metadataCollectionVar som innehåller beskrivningen av fältet. Om man t.ex. har fältet \\"Synlig publikt\\" med valen Ja/Nej så pekar metadataCollectionVariablen ut en collectionVariable med valen Ja/Nej, men själva beskrivningen av fältet, vad frågan handlar om, beskrivs i metadataCollectionVariable. En metadataCollectionVariable kan också ha ett final value.\\n\\nMetadataCollectionVariable används också för att definiera attribut. Då sätter man ett final value som är ett värde som måste finnas i den utpekade collectionVariablen."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Validation type for the record type metadataCollectionVariable. A metadataCollectionVariable is the metadata component used to define a list of choices. It is the metadataCollectionVar that contains the description of the field. If you e.g. has the field \\"Visible public\\" with the choices Yes/No, the metadataCollectionVariable points out a collectionVariable with the choices Yes/No, but the description of the field itself, what the question is about, is described in the metadataCollectionVariable. A metadataCollectionVariable can also have a final value.\\n\\nMetadataCollectionVariable is also used to define attributes. Then you set a final value, which is a value that must be in the designated collectionVariable."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
text	metadataDefText	cora	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "cora"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "coraText"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "metadataDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "12345"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2017-10-01T00:00:00.000000Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "12345"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2017-11-01T17:37:36.000000Z"}], "repeatId": "0"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-03-02T15:27:31.346079Z"}], "repeatId": "1"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2025-02-26T16:56:36.392935Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}], "repeatId": "2"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Metadata används för att definiera vad data som hanteras av systemet kan och får innehålla. Detta görs genom att det från en recordType pekas det ut en metadatapost som beskriver en metadatagrupp som i sin tur pekar ut andra metadataposter och på det sättet skapar ett träd som beskriver datat för posttypen."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Metadata is used to define what data handled by the system can and may contain. This is done by selecting a metadata record from a recordType that describes a metadata group that in turn points to other metadata records, thus creating a tree that describes the data for the record type."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Metadata brukes til å definere hvilke data som administreres av systemet kan og kan inneholde. Dette gjøres ved å velge en metadatapost fra en recordType som beskriver en metadatagruppe, som igjen velger andre metadataposter, og dermed lage et tre som beskriver dataene for posttypen."}], "attributes": {"lang": "no", "type": "alternative"}}]}
