text	metadataGroupValidationDefText	cora	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "id", "value": "metadataGroupValidationDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "cora"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "coraText"}]}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-03-02T09:02:00.142941Z"}], "repeatId": "0"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-03-02T15:22:49.232489Z"}], "repeatId": "1"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-06-16T12:28:02.964455Z"}], "repeatId": "2"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-06-16T12:28:15.404341Z"}], "repeatId": "3"}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2023-03-02T09:02:00.142941Z"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Validerings typ för posttypen metadataGroup. En metadataGroup är en komponent som håller ihop andra metadatakomponenter. Grupper kan också vara nästlade i varandra. I en metadataGroup pekar man ut de barn som ska ingå i gruppen genom att ange typ (metadataTextVar, metadataNumberVar, metadataGroup etc.) och id på barnet. För varje barn anger man hur många gånger det får/måste förekomma. 0-1 så får det förekomma en gång, 1-1 så är det obligatoriskt. Ett X som max-värde betyder att det får förekomma hur många gånger som helst. Om ett barn får förekomma mer än en gång så kommer det att få ett repeatId i sin data-representation."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Validation type for the record type metadataGroup. A metadataGroup is a component that holds other metadata components together. Groups can also be nested within each other. In a metadataGroup, you select the children who are to be included in the group by specifying the type (metadataTextVar, metadataNumberVar, metadataGroup etc.) and ID of the child. For each child, you specify how many times it may/must occur. 0-1 then it may occur once, 1-1 then it is mandatory. An X as the maximum value means that it may occur as many times as desired. If a child is allowed to occur more than once, it will receive a repeatId in its data representation."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
