n eller flera metadataCollectionVariables. t.ex. kan man skapa en collection som innehåller valen Ja/Nej, och sen använda den i vitt skilda variabler. Själva listan (metadataItemCollection) behöver bara finnas en gång."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Validation type for the record type metadataItemCollection. A metadataItemCollection is a collection of a number of metadataCollectionItems. The list can then be used in one or more metadataCollectionVariables. for example can you create a collection that contains the choices Yes/No, and then use it in widely different variables. The list itself (metadataItemCollection) only needs to exist once."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
