 {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Validation type for the record type metadataNumberVariable. A metadataNumberVariable is used when it should be possible to enter a non-predetermined numeric value, e.g. number of authors. Restrictions on what may be entered into a metadataTextVariable are specified by a minimum/maximum allowed value. You can also specify lower and upper warning limits, as well as how many decimal places the field may contain."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
