text	metadataRecordLinkValidationDefText	cora	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "cora"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "coraText"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "metadataRecordLinkValidationDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2023-03-02T09:01:52.383966Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2026-02-11T16:11:15.853744Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Validerings typ för posttypen metadataRecordLink. En metadataRecordLink definierar en länk till en annan post. Om man t.ex. har en artikel där man kan ange en författare, som i sig är en recordType person, så skapar man en metadataRecordLink som pekar på person."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Validation type for the record type metadataRecordLink. A metadataRecordLink defines a link to another record. If you e.g. have an article where you can specify an author, which in itself is a recordType person, then you create a metadataRecordLink that points to person."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Valideringstype for posttypen metadataRecordLink. En metadataRecordLink definerer en lenke til en annen post. Hvis du for eksempel har en artikkel der du kan spesifisere en forfatter, som i seg selv er en recordType person, oppretter du en metadataRecordLink som peker til person."}], "attributes": {"lang": "no", "type": "alternative"}}]}
