text	metadataTextVariableValidationDefText	cora	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "id", "value": "metadataTextVariableValidationDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "cora"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "coraText"}]}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-03-02T09:01:57.865042Z"}], "repeatId": "0"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-03-02T15:22:45.856153Z"}], "repeatId": "1"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-06-16T12:23:11.483893Z"}], "repeatId": "2"}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2023-03-02T09:01:57.865042Z"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Validerings typ för posttypen metadataTextVariable. En metadataTextVariable används när det ska vara möjligt att mata in ett icke förutbestämt värde, t.ex. namn på författare, titel på artikel o.s.v. Begränsningar för vad som får matas in i en metadataTextVariable anges genom ett reguljärt uttryck. En textvariabel kan också ha ett final value, d.v.s ett enda tillåtet värde. Det används när man vill ha ett förbestämt värde i en post."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Validation type for the record type metadataTextVariable.A metadataTextVariable is used when it should be possible to enter a non-predetermined value, e.g. name of author, title of article, etc. Restrictions on what may be entered into a metadataTextVariable are specified by a regular expression. A text variable can also have a final value, i.e. a single allowed value. It is used when you want a predetermined value in an entry."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
