text	presentationSurroundingContainerGroupDefText	cora	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "id", "value": "presentationSurroundingContainerGroupDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "cora"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "coraText"}]}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2018-01-25T08:34:53.405000Z"}], "repeatId": "0"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-03-02T15:28:25.886590Z"}], "repeatId": "1"}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2018-01-10T15:19:11.650000Z"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "En omgivande container används för att gruppera ihop texter och presentationer som ingår i en grupp så att de presenteras som om de låg i en gemensam barngrupp. Detta ger också möjligheten att för dessa grupperade presentationer göra en alternativ presentation som går att växla till.\\n\\nT.ex. kan man göra gruppen \\"Övrigt\\" som grupperar ihop lösa barn så att rubriken \\"Övrigt\\" bara visas om det finns data för något av barnen och barnen visuellt ser ut att höra ihop."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "A surrounding container is used to group together texts and presentations that belong to a group so that they are presented as if they were in a common group of children. This also allows for these grouped presentations to make an alternative presentation that can be switched to.\\n\\nFor example. it is possible to make the group \\"Other information\\" that group together loose children so that the heading \\"Other information\\" only appears if there is data for one of the children, and the children visually seem to belong together."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
