text	presentationViewIdLinkDefText	cora	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "cora"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "coraText"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "presentationViewIdLinkDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2017-10-01T00:00:00.000000Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2026-03-04T11:15:35.496445Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Visningspresentation definierar på en övergripande nivå hur postens formulär skall visas. Presentationen beskriver i vilken ordning fälten visas, och vilka rubriker och ledtexter som ska finnas. Den kan innehålla generell information om hur presentationen ska stylas, t.ex att en ledtext är en rubrik på en viss nivå. Däremot innehåller presentationen ingen information om specifika färger, fonter etc som används, utan det bestäms av implementerande klient."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Display presentation defines on an overall level how the record's form should be displayed. The presentation describes the order in which the fields are displayed, and which headings and captions should be present. It can contain general information about how the presentation should be styled, for example that a leading text is a heading at a certain level. However, the presentation does not contain information about specific colors, fonts, etc. that are used, but that is determined by the implementing client."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
