text	publicRecordTypeCollectionVarDefText	cora	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "cora"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "coraText"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "publicRecordTypeCollectionVarDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2019-01-21T10:05:51.671000Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2019-01-21T10:05:51.671000Z"}], "repeatId": "0"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2019-01-21T10:20:19.401000Z"}], "repeatId": "1"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2019-01-21T10:21:46.326000Z"}], "repeatId": "2"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2019-02-01T09:19:48.460000Z"}], "repeatId": "3"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2023-03-02T15:24:26.474768Z"}], "repeatId": "4"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2025-02-24T15:38:11.106696Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}], "repeatId": "5"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2025-04-02T09:06:13.007201Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "141414"}]}], "repeatId": "6"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Styr om allt data för posttypen är publikt, dvs att alla användare (även oinloggade) får läsa samtliga poster av posttypen. Notera att när posttypen är publik kommer ingen användare att få läsrättighet till delar av posterna som begränsas med \\"läsbegränsning för del av post\\". Notera också att andra actions än READ styrs av användarens normala rättigheter."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Controls whether all data for the record type is public, i.e. all users (even not logged in) can read all records of the record type. Note that when the record type is public, no user will have read access to parts of the records that are restricted with \\"read restriction for part of record\\". Also note that actions other than READ are controlled by the user's normal rights."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Styrer om alle data for posttypen er offentlige, det vil si at alle brukere (selv uloggede) kan lese alle poster av posttypen. Merk at når posttypen er offentlig, vil ingen bruker ha lesetilgang til deler av postene som er begrenset med \\"lesebegrensning for del av posten\\". Merk også at andre handlinger enn READ er kontrollert av brukerens normale rettigheter."}], "attributes": {"lang": "no", "type": "alternative"}}]}
